    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Day 7\r\n\r\nOne of my crewmates jumped in. Into the water, infested
        with those dangerous fish. All for proof that their \u201Ctruth\u201D, their
        \u201Cleader\u201D is real, that these weird hand structures are part of
        its long reaching arms. Nobody cared when he died, consumed by fish with
        hands just the same as this structure, because they were too busy enamoured
        by those words, \u201CIt\u2019s real! I saw it! He is here with us!\u201D,
        not even he himself seemed scared. These people aren\u2019t the crew I once
        knew, that I could turn to, my hope has died for good. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 4
